WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.754
In one day, your agents might take three hundred actions.

2
00:00:03.784 --> 00:00:06.710
You are not going to read three hundred things.

3
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.209
So sort them. Four tiers.

4
00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:13.472
Tier one. Just do it, and tell me after. Edits on a branch.

5
00:00:13.502 --> 00:00:15.960
Running tests. Most actions land here.

6
00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.065
Tier two. Do it, unless I say stop.

7
00:00:19.095 --> 00:00:22.467
Things I'd notice, like changing a schedule.

8
00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:27.311
Tier three. Nothing moves until I say yes. Spending real money.

9
00:00:27.341 --> 00:00:31.120
Reaching a real person. Anything that can't be undone.

10
00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.299
Tier four. Everything else.

11
00:00:33.329 --> 00:00:37.645
Decide, and write down what you decided, so I can change it later.

12
00:00:38.075 --> 00:00:40.633
Three hundred actions. A handful reach you.

13
00:00:40.663 --> 00:00:42.739
You approve consequences, not code.
